@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "gym-buddy Android App" {
  [Compose UI] as UI
  [Camera Controller\n(CameraX)] as Camera
  [Pose Perception\n(MediaPipe)] as Pose
  [Signal Processor] as Signal
  [Exercise Analyzer\nIncline DB Press first] as Analyzer
  [Rep State Machine] as RepSM
  [Biomechanics Metrics] as Metrics
  [Deterministic Rule Engine] as Rules
  [Cue Engine\nOverlay + TTS] as Cue
  [Workout Repository] as Repo
  [Health Connect Adapter] as Health
  [Room Database] as Room
}

UI --> Camera : start/stop session
Camera --> Pose : frames
Pose --> Signal : pose landmarks
Signal --> Analyzer : smoothed landmarks
Analyzer --> RepSM : temporal movement state
Analyzer --> Metrics : joint / trajectory features
RepSM --> Metrics : phase context
Metrics --> Rules : derived metrics
Rules --> Cue : form events
Cue --> UI : realtime overlay
Cue --> [Android TextToSpeech]
Analyzer --> Repo : pose samples / reps / metrics
Rules --> Repo : form events
Health --> Repo : daily health context
Repo --> Room
UI --> Repo : history / session state

note bottom of Pose
ML ends here.
Everything downstream is normal code.
end note

note bottom of Rules
Rules must be deterministic,
versioned, testable, and explainable.
end note

@enduml
